- Unlock ladder with verification and OEM awareness: (1) Accessibility gestures + PIN/pattern entry on the keyguard (some OEM lock screens block this - detect it); (2) privileged shell input (Shizuku/ADB tier); (3) the Smart Lock options the phone actually offers (trusted device / place / on-body) as guidance; (4) root. Device Admin can only LOCK the phone, it cannot unlock it - do not pretend otherwise. The PIN lives only in Android Keystore + encrypted storage; never logged, never sent to the cloud, masked in the UI.
